// REQUIRES: host-linux-amd64 || host-linux-arm64
// RUN: %gopp build -emit=gir %S/Inputs/inst-passmodes.gopp 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
// P04.08 with P04.18: the pass mode of a parameter (passOf) is decided on the
// instance's real types, not on the generic body's. `Len` takes a borrowed
// `Pair[K, V]`: with a string in it, the instance takes the caller's place (a
// pointer, PAR-10); with two ints it is a copy. Both are `linkonce_odr`
// (they fold across objects).
// CHECK-DAG: fn _GPIF4mainE3LenirE(_1: *main.Pair[int, string]) -> i64 [go, linkonce_odr]
// CHECK-DAG: fn _GPIF4mainE3LeniiE(_1: main.Pair[int, int]) -> i64 [go, linkonce_odr]
